<p>Fire an arrow for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage. When the arrow reaches its destination or hits a target it will draw in all other targets in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> and inflict <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>Each target moved beyond the first increases the damage <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">17, 24, 28, 32, 36</acronym> (up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">70, 94, 113, 129, 143</acronym> bonus damage).</p><p>Targets take reduced damage the further they are from the epicenter (20% less per tile).</p><p>The additional damage scales with your Spellpower.</p>